WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.711
A safe parsing workflow starts by cleaning boundary
whitespace Then

00:00:05.737 --> 00:00:11.387
identify the input shape Apply the parser that
matches that shape

00:00:13.099 --> 00:00:17.217
If the value does not match an expected format
return NULL or flag it for

00:00:17.243 --> 00:00:23.428
review instead of guessing Parsing converts
representation It

00:00:23.441 --> 00:00:26.810
does not prove that the underlying business value is
accurate
